  "details": "What happens: SDK3 worlds fail to upload when Unity's temp dir is on a case sensitive filesystem. The .vrcw file does get correctly built in the correct location. The error dialog indicating something is wrong provides no hint as to why. There are no errors in the editor log.\n\nWhat is expected: The world is built & uploaded \n\nSteps to reproduce: Mount a case sensitive filesystem on AppData/Local/Temp and attempt to build & upload a world.",
